          "unit_id": "what_if",
          "title": "On the Bridge",
          "description": "Cuando el pasado cambia el presente: condicionales mixtos. Y los artículos con nombres abstractos: life, happiness, the life I have now.",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "lesson_id": "what_if_lesson",
              "title": "Mixed conditionals",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "phase": "context",
                  "type": "audio_context",
                  "content": {
                    "title": "On the bridge",
                    "dialogue": [
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "I can't believe you've lived here for almost three years."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Me neither. If I hadn't taken that job, I wouldn't be here now."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "And you wouldn't be moving in with Daniel!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "True. And if you hadn't passed your exam, you wouldn't be working in Dublin."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "If I weren't so lazy, I would have passed it the first time!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Do you ever wonder what would have happened if I'd stayed in Madrid?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "You'd be bored, and you'd still speak terrible English."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Thanks a lot!"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "Seriously, if you weren't so brave, you would never have left Spain."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "I don't feel brave. I just wanted an adventure."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "And now? What's the next adventure?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Actually… I've been thinking about starting my own design studio."
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Javi",
                        "text": "Your own studio? Does Helen know?"
                      },
                      {
                        "speaker": "Lucía",
                        "text": "Not yet. That's the next difficult conversation."
                      }
                    ],
                    "passage": "May. Javi is visiting Bristol from Dublin for the first time. He and Lucía are standing on the Clifton Suspension Bridge, looking down at the river."
                  }
                },
                {
                  "phase": "discovery",
                  "type": "multiple_choice",
                  "content": {
